SUMMARY:TORRENCE BRANNON: A Birthday Celebration & Fundraiser for  Fa-Mli I
 
nc.
LOCATION:Catalina Jazz Club\, Hollywood
DESCRIPTION:Torrence Brannon-Reese is a dynamic New Orleansborn vocalist\, 
 
songwriter\, poet\, and guitarist celebrated for his remarkable four-octave
 
 vocal range. Blending soul\, R&B\, jazz\, funk\, gospel\, and the rich mus
 
ical traditions of his hometown\, he delivers performances filled with pass
 
ion\, authenticity\, and powerful storytelling. As the leader of Everything
 
 with Soul and a member of the acclaimed a cappella group Street Corner Ren
 
aissance\, Brannon-Reese is also deeply committed to preserving Black music
 
 and uplifting his community through the arts and education.Catalina Jazz C
 
lub6725 West Sunset Blvd.Hollywood\, CA 90028*Tickets purchased online rece
 
